Package: evalueHMM
Type: Package
Title: Predictive E-Diagnostics for Hidden Markov Models of Animal Movement
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Aurelien",
      family = "Nicosia",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "aurelien.nicosia@ulaval.ca"
    )
  )
Description: Implements predictive e-diagnostics for hidden Markov models (HMMs)
    applied to animal movement data. Supports computation of predictive densities,
    e-processes, diagnostic combinations, localized diagnostics, and envelope constructions.
